│ Message.locations duplicate unnecessary      │
│ ### Describe the bug                         │
│                                              │
│ When running                                 │
│                                              │
│ `make clean; make gettext`                   │
│                                              │
│ there are times the list of locations is     │
│ duplicated unnecessarily, example:           │
│                                              │
│ ```                                          │
│ #:                                           │
│ ../../manual/render/shader_nodes/vector/vect │
│ or_rotate.rst:38                             │
